+# Console Selection Import/Export Hotfix — 2026-06-12
+
+## Problem
+
+`ai_bridge_supervisor.py` could import `configure_windows_console_selection` while a partially patched local tree still had an older `terminal_style.py` without that symbol. Startup then failed before config loading.
+
+## Fix
+
+- `terminal_style.py` exports `configure_windows_console_selection(policy)` and keeps `disable_windows_quick_edit()` as a compatibility wrapper.
+- `ai_bridge_supervisor.py` imports the function with a compatibility fallback.
+- Console selection is applied after `workspace.v1.json` environment is loaded.
+- The old import-time QuickEdit disable path remains removed.
+
+## Expected log
+
+```text
+[INFO ] Console selection policy applied mode=allow
+```
